{"route":"/hop/wiki/perks/cracked","title":"Cracked Doubles - House of Pips Wiki","description":"Cracked Doubles (Malus) in House of Pips: A scoring double loses 5 points.","html":"<p class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks\">Perks</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks#malus\">Malus</a></p>\n<article class=\"entry rarity-malus\" id=\"perk-cracked\">\n<header class=\"entry-head\">\n<img class=\"entry-icon\" src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/cracked-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\">\n<div><h1>Cracked Doubles</h1><p class=\"entry-sub\">Malus &middot; Scoring penalty</p></div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"entry-body\">\n<div class=\"entry-main\">\n<blockquote class=\"card-text\"><p>A scoring double loses 5 points.</p><footer>In-game card text</footer></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<p><strong>Malus.</strong> A scoring play made <strong>with a double loses 5 points for each copy</strong>, after every bonus and multiplier. It can't take the play below zero.</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"ref rarity-uncommon\" href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/shield\" title=\"Uncommon perk\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/shield-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Pip Shield</a> can give the points back, and <a class=\"ref ref-skill\" href=\"/hop/wiki/skills#malus_ward\" title=\"Skill tree: House Rules\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/skills/malus_ward-icon.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"ref-icon\">Malus Ward</a> can block it.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"at-a-glance\">At a glance</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"facts\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Rarity</th><td><span class=\"pill rarity-malus\">Malus</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Type</th><td>Scoring penalty</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">How to get it</th><td>Never bought. A Malus card is dealt into every standard draft.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"entry-card\"><a href=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/cracked-card.png\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/cracked-card.png\" alt=\"The Cracked Doubles card as drawn in the game\" width=\"468\" height=\"498\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The card as it appears in a draft.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</article>\n<nav class=\"pager\" aria-label=\"Neighbouring perks\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/greedy\">&larr; Greedy Draw</a><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/leak\">Leaky Pocket &rarr;</a></nav>","toc":[]}